## Switzerland — src/countries/ch/data/

Kantone (cantons).

Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
Source: Poulpy, "Switzerland Cantons Map with Names and Capitals (french)"
https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Switzerland_Cantons_Map_with_Names_and_Capitals_(french).svg
Itself derived from "Suisse cantons.svg" by Pymouss44.

The two files upstream carry different tags on Commons — CC BY 3.0 on Poulpy's,
CC BY-SA 4.0 on the Pymouss44 original it derives from. Share-alike is the
stricter of the two, so the data ships as CC BY-SA 4.0 and both authors are
credited, the same principle applied to any mixed-source data here.

Only the canton boundaries were taken. The source also carries a lakes layer and
an international-border outline.

