## Attribution overlay

Map components render an attribution overlay by default, which is what satisfies
the attribution requirement of the licences above at runtime.

Setting `showAttributions={false}` removes it. That is permitted, but it moves
the attribution obligation onto whoever does it — they must credit the source
elsewhere in their interface or documentation.
